  "label": "Jewish men are mapped as the controllers of global media and education",
  "description": "The text 'we jews control all white countries media & education' explicitly maps the caricatured Jewish men (visual entities) onto the role of global controllers of media and education (textual claim). The visual depiction of the two men, especially the one holding a book, reinforces the stereotype of Jewish intellectual control, which is directly linked to the textual assertion of media and education control.",
